abstract: "BanglaBBQ is a bilingual (English-Bengali) QA benchmark adapted from the Bias Benchmark for Question Answering (BBQ) and PakBBQ frameworks to evaluate social, cultural, and political biases in Large Language Models within the context of Bangladesh."
